Agent instructions for this repository are in AGENTS.md (repo root). Read it first.
Resolve the Git root first; run every knowledge/... lookup from there, even when the current directory is nested.
Find knowledge via knowledge/INDEX.json — use only status: "ready" docs; when_to_use says
when a doc applies, tags and topic narrow it. knowledge/SIGNALS.json maps a repository
file to the applicable docs and an API name in the diff to the docs that govern it.
Skip a doc whose applies_to names a variant this repo does not use. Ignore draft stubs.
Verify with the topic 98/99/100 checklists; each section names the rule behind its items.
